{"1531180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Isle", "steam_appid": 1531180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Isle is a game of ingenuity and sheer will to survive. Each experience is what you make of it. Every day is a new chance to rise to the top, and every death is an opportunity for sweet revenge. While embracing the core systems of the open-world survival craft genre, <i>Lost Isle</i> adds a medieval, fresh fantasy twist to engage the seasoned survivalist or the new adventurer alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve out an existence in an unforgiving environment disguised as a paradise. Shipwrecked on the prison-tomb of Mauroth, whose cosmic energy mutates the land, animals, minerals, plants, and resources, face off against monstrous creatures and rival players in a massive medieval fantasy survival experience. Armed with nothing but a knife and candlelight, you must endure to live another day </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/45675cd5aefa79287cc0cd12c306d861.poster.avif?t=1784480839\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/45675cd5aefa79287cc0cd12c306d861.webm?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/45675cd5aefa79287cc0cd12c306d861.mp4?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive Your Way With or Without Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you prefer to play as a spell-slinging wizard, arrow-flinging archer, or classic sword-wielding knight, there are weapons and armor for each playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/f74070edae80ca10b00ec57d27a2ed9f.poster.avif?t=1784480839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/f74070edae80ca10b00ec57d27a2ed9f.webm?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/f74070edae80ca10b00ec57d27a2ed9f.mp4?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience Massive PvP &amp; PvE Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense PvP and PvE gameplay on high-performance dedicated servers with up to 200 players. Hunt wildlife, survive predators, and battle deadly enemies like skeletal warriors, night beasts, forest golems, or other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/6df98edeeda0887305bd6aca799d24ca.poster.avif?t=1784480839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/6df98edeeda0887305bd6aca799d24ca.webm?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/6df98edeeda0887305bd6aca799d24ca.mp4?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a Rich Medieval Fantasy Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an alternate medieval earth shaped by the fallen god Mauroth and infused with cosmic energy that flows through the earth into every root and vein. Delve deep and discover flora and fauna, some familiar and others otherworldly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master Skill-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover burning forests, colossal beasts, enchanted flora, and rare materials used to craft powerful gear and build structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take on Strange Mythical Creatures and Harness Their Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover burning forests, colossal beasts, enchanted flora, and rare materials used to craft powerful gear and build structures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/7de8ceab4d03942754a59e773dea699f.poster.avif?t=1784480839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/7de8ceab4d03942754a59e773dea699f.webm?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/7de8ceab4d03942754a59e773dea699f.mp4?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A New Adventure Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the biome and landscape generation to point-of-interest locations, to the stats and effects of weapons and armor, each wipe cycle you play will be a brand-new adventure for you and your fellowship of survivalists.</p>", "about_the_