e earth into every root and vein. Delve deep and discover flora and fauna, some familiar and others otherworldly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master Skill-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover burning forests, colossal beasts, enchanted flora, and rare materials used to craft powerful gear and build structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take on Strange Mythical Creatures and Harness Their Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover burning forests, colossal beasts, enchanted flora, and rare materials used to craft powerful gear and build structures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/7de8ceab4d03942754a59e773dea699f.poster.avif?t=1784480839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/7de8ceab4d03942754a59e773dea699f.webm?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1531180/extras/7de8ceab4d03942754a59e773dea699f.mp4?t=1784480839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A New Adventure Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the biome and landscape generation to point-of-interest locations, to the stats and effects of weapons and armor, each wipe cycle you play will be a brand-new adventure for you and your fellowship of survivalists.</p>", "short_description": "Castaway on an island built upon the corpse of a dead god. Build settlements, master melee, archery, and magic. Choose your fate in huge multip